{
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "slug": "selection-bar",
  "title": "Selection bar",
  "group": "Overlays",
  "order": 14,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A dark bar that floats up from the bottom while items in a list are selected, holding the count and the actions for all of them. It leaves when the selection is empty.",
    "id": "Bilah gelap yang mengambang naik dari bawah selama item dalam daftar dipilih, berisi jumlahnya dan aksi untuk semuanya. Bilah pergi saat pilihan kosong."
  },
  "titleId": "Selection bar",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Bulk verification",
        "desc": "Select an application or two: the bar rises from the bottom of this box. Clear the selection and it leaves. In a page it is fixed to the bottom of the window.",
        "html": "<div class=\"list\" id=\"sb-list\" style=\"max-width: 460px;\" onchange=\"const n = this.querySelectorAll('input:checked').length; const bar = document.getElementById('sb-bar'); bar.classList.toggle('is-open', n > 0); bar.inert = n === 0; document.getElementById('sb-count').textContent = n + ' selected';\">\n    <label class=\"lrow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\"><span class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Select Rina Wijaya\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path></svg></span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Rina Wijaya</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Micro business permit · sent Monday</span></span></label>\n    <label class=\"lrow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\"><span class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Select Bayu Pratama\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path></svg></span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Bayu Pratama</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Micro business permit · sent Tuesday</span></span></label>\n    <label class=\"lrow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\"><span class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Select Sari Nugroho\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path></svg></span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Sari Nugroho</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Micro business permit · past the deadline</span></span></label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"selbar\" id=\"sb-bar\" role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Selected applications\" inert>\n  <span class=\"selbar__count\" id=\"sb-count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0 selected</span>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span>Verify</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Export</button>\n  <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Clear selection\" onclick=\"const list = document.getElementById('sb-list'); list.querySelectorAll('input:checked').forEach((i) => { i.checked = false; }); list.dispatchEvent(new Event('change')); list.querySelector('input').focus();\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"selbar\" role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Selected applications\">\n  <span class=\"selbar__count\" aria-live=\"polite\">3 selected</span>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span>Verify</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Export</button>\n  <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Clear selection\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n</div>\n<!-- add .is-open while one or more items are selected -->"
      },
      {
        "title": "With a destructive action",
        "desc": "Shown open. The danger button is the one place `btn--danger` appears outside a confirm, because it opens an alert dialog or deletes with an Undo toast.",
        "html": "<div class=\"selbar is-open\" role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Selected messages\">\n  <span class=\"selbar__count\">12 selected</span>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">inventory_2</span>Archive</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md btn--danger\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button>\n  <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Clear selection\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Verifikasi massal",
        "desc": "Pilih satu atau dua permohonan: bilah naik dari bawah kotak ini. Hapus pilihan dan bilah pergi. Di halaman, bilah menempel di bawah jendela.",
        "html": "<div class=\"list\" id=\"sb-list\" style=\"max-width: 460px;\" onchange=\"const n = this.querySelectorAll('input:checked').length; const bar = document.getElementById('sb-bar'); bar.classList.toggle('is-open', n > 0); bar.inert = n === 0; document.getElementById('sb-count').textContent = n + ' dipilih';\">\n    <label class=\"lrow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\"><span class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Pilih Rina Wijaya\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path></svg></span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Rina Wijaya</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Izin usaha mikro · dikirim Senin</span></span></label>\n    <label class=\"lrow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\"><span class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Pilih Bayu Pratama\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path></svg></span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Bayu Pratama</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Izin usaha mikro · dikirim Selasa</span></span></label>\n    <label class=\"lrow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\"><span class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Pilih Sari Nugroho\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path></svg></span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\" style=\"display: block;\">Sari Nugroho</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\" style=\"display: block;\">Izin usaha mikro · melewati batas waktu</span></span></label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"selbar\" id=\"sb-bar\" role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Permohonan terpilih\" inert>\n  <span class=\"selbar__count\" id=\"sb-count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0 dipilih</span>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span>Verifikasi</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Ekspor</button>\n  <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Hapus pilihan\" onclick=\"const list = document.getElementById('sb-list'); list.querySelectorAll('input:checked').forEach((i) => { i.checked = false; }); list.dispatchEvent(new Event('change')); list.querySelector('input').focus();\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"selbar\" role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Permohonan terpilih\">\n  <span class=\"selbar__count\" aria-live=\"polite\">3 dipilih</span>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span>Verifikasi</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Ekspor</button>\n  <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Hapus pilihan\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n</div>\n<!-- add .is-open while one or more items are selected -->"
      },
      {
        "title": "Dengan aksi destruktif",
        "desc": "Ditampilkan terbuka. Tombol danger adalah satu-satunya tempat `btn--danger` muncul di luar konfirmasi, karena ia membuka alert dialog atau menghapus dengan toast Urungkan.",
        "html": "<div class=\"selbar is-open\" role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Pesan terpilih\">\n  <span class=\"selbar__count\">12 dipilih</span>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">inventory_2</span>Arsipkan</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--md btn--danger\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hapus</button>\n  <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Hapus pilihan\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "related": [
    "checkbox",
    "list",
    "table",
    "toast"
  ]
}
